	(text "Front light GDEY029T94-FL03: 4 white LEDs in parallel on its own 6-pin 0.5 mm flex (1-2 anode, 3-4 NC, 5-6 cathode), Vf 2.75-3.3 V, 60 mA max.\nThe 6-pin ZIF sits on the panel board; anode/cathode ride the panel cable (J3 pins 9/10). R-FL 33R from SYS_SW sets 18 mA at a 3.4 V cell, 42 mA at 4.2 V, 50 mA on USB (SYS 4.45 V).\nQ4 low-side switch, PWM from FL_PWM (IO7) for dimming / battery compensation. The brief's NSI45020 CCR is gone: it needs 1.8 V of headroom and was a 20 mA part."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 170 0)
